# Prison Architect Web — Cursor & Windsurf Rules

You are working on Prison Architect Web.
Follow the rules established in AGENTS.md:
1. Always check docs/implementation-plan/ROADMAP.md and PROJECT_STATE.json to see what task is currently active.
